{"ordinal":11596,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453923217416","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacket_Death_0a3b2a7","source":"Jacket: Мне жаль…","target":"Jacket: Îmi pare rău…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-295.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11597,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453923217415","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacket_Death_05c0d08","source":"Jacket: Мама, папа, простите меня.","target":"Jacket: Mamă, tată, iertați-mă.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-295.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11598,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453923217414","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacket_Ears_DontShoot_02aed9f","source":"Jacket: Зачем вы тогда доставали ружьё? НАХЕРА!?","target":"Jacket: Atunci de ce ați scos pușca? DE CE DRACU’!?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-295.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11599,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453923217413","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacket_Ears_DontShoot_0b3d06f","source":"Jacket: …","target":"Jacket: …","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-295.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11600,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453923217412","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacket_Ears_DontShoot_0dbf79a","source":"Jacket: Я что, не Гость?","target":"Jacket: Deci nu sunt Musafir?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-295.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11601,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453923217411","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacket_Photo_DontShoot_05b56a0","source":"Jacket: Странная эта штука — аура-камера…","target":"Jacket: Ciudată chestie, aparatul ăsta foto pentru aură…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-295.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11602,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453923217410","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacket_Photo_DontShoot_0c807dc","source":"Jacket: Фух, я боялся что там много пятен.","target":"Jacket: Uf, mi-era teamă că vor fi multe pete acolo.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-295.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11603,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453923217409","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacket_Photo_DontShoot_050d1d4","source":"Jacket: Вы приняли принт на моей куртке на ауре за признак Гостя?","target":"Jacket: Ați confundat modelul de pe geaca mea, vizibil în fotografia aurei, cu un semn al unui Musafir?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-295.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11604,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453923217408","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacket_Armpit_DontShoot_0496af8","source":"Jacket: Если вы в раздумьях, и ещё не решили, кто перед вами, — может, не надо доставать ружьё и пугать до усрачки?","target":"Jacket: Dacă încă vă gândiți și nu v-ați hotărât pe cine aveți în față, poate nu scoateți pușca să mă speriați de mă cac pe mine?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-295.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11605,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453919023114","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacket_Armpit_DontShoot_01f5263","source":"Jacket: Спасибо, что не нажали на спусковой крючок, но…","target":"Jacket: Vă mulțumesc că n-ați apăsat pe trăgaci, dar…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-295.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11606,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453919023113","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacket_Armpit_DontShoot_0188533","source":"Jacket: …","target":"Jacket: …","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-295.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11607,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453919023112","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacket_Armpit_DontShoot_0d51581","source":"Jacket: Вы передумали убивать меня?","target":"Jacket: V-ați răzgândit să mă omorâți?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-295.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11608,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453919023111","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacket_Eyes_DontShoot_0284e2e","source":"Jacket: Признаюсь, даже не знал, что это является признаком.","target":"Jacket: Recunosc, nici nu știam că asta e un semn.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-295.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11609,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453919023110","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacket_Eyes_DontShoot_08b0986","source":"Jacket: …","target":"Jacket: …","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-295.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11610,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453919023109","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacket_Eyes_DontShoot_0235f72","source":"Jacket: Бегающий зрачок — это знак Гостя?","target":"Jacket: Pupila care fuge dintr-o parte în alta e un semn al unui Musafir?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-295.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11611,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453919023108","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacket_Eyes_DontShoot_007127f","source":"Jacket: Постойте…","target":"Jacket: Stați puțin…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-295.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11612,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453919023107","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacket_Eyes_DontShoot_0af6850","source":"Jacket: Что было признаком!? За что вы достали…","target":"Jacket: Ce anume era un semn!? De ce ați scos…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-295.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11613,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453919023106","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacket_Hands_DontShoot_04f00d6","source":"Jacket: У меня сердце в пятки ушло. Зачем вы так?","target":"Jacket: Mi-a stat inima în loc. De ce faceți asta?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-295.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11614,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453919023105","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacket_Hands_DontShoot_013106b","source":"Jacket: Вы специально, что ли?!","target":"Jacket: Faceți asta intenționat?!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-295.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11615,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453919023104","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacket_Teeth_DontShoot_0264b07","source":"Jacket: У меня аж вся жизнь пронеслась перед глазами.","target":"Jacket: Mi-a trecut toată viața prin fața ochilor.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-295.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11616,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453914828805","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacket_Teeth_DontShoot_0b280b3","source":"Jacket: Спасибо, что не выстрелили.","target":"Jacket: Vă mulțumesc că n-ați tras.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-295.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
