{"ordinal":11619,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453914828802","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacket_Ears_Gun_0c9d31b","source":"Jacket: Что там?","target":"Jacket: Ce se vede acolo?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-295.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11620,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453914828801","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacket_Ears_Gun_0d0912b","source":"Jacket: Стойте, что не так с ушами?","target":"Jacket: Stați, ce nu e în regulă cu urechile?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-295.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
