{"ordinal":11631,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453910634497","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacket_Eyes_Gun_0e8e5c2","source":"Jacket: Но глаза ведь не красные!","target":"Jacket: Dar ochii mei nici măcar nu sunt roșii!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-295.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11632,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453910634496","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacket_Eyes_Gun_032f3d5","source":"Jacket: Что?! Я Гость?","target":"Jacket: Ce?! Sunt Musafir?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-295.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11633,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453906440202","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacket_Hands_Gun_0849c48","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11634,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453906440201","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacket_Hands_Gun_0500823","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11635,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453906440200","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacket_Hands_Gun_0dc2ef1","source":"Jacket: Я НЕ ГОСТЬ, НЕ СТРЕЛЯЙТЕ!!!","target":"Jacket: NU SUNT MUSAFIR, NU TRAGEȚI!!!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-295.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11636,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453906440199","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacket_Hands_Gun_091c1bf","source":"Jacket: Постойте, но на руках ведь ничего нет!","target":"Jacket: Stați, dar pe mâini nu se vede nimic!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-295.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11637,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453906440198","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacket_Hands_Gun_07d4abb","source":"Jacket: Постойте, но я же объяснил, что раздражение из-за куртки!","target":"Jacket: Stați, v-am explicat că iritația e de la geacă!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-295.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11638,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453906440197","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacket_Teeth_Gun_082f85e","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
